{
  "_doc": "Tombstones for the garment-variant URL scheme (/shop/<slug>/<style>/): one page per garment style, live for a few hours on 2026-09-05 and reverted the same day (PR #32 + #31, 'Revert garment variant feature'). The variant URLs were in the sitemap while live, so crawlers fetched some of them and they have answered 404 ever since. src/build.py's page_redirects() serves a noindex redirect stub at each path, targeting the design's collection page - same treatment as any retired product URL, because this site's invariant is that a once-published URL never 404s. If the variant feature is ever reworked and a path here goes live again, delete its entry: the build never re-adds it (this file is a hand-maintained record, read on every build).",
